    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "dantherentalman",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105102462185006039010/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKDDFGaViDWnPvocgiiz_4-YkCxrABl9nbCBRPBB4lJa7YuMw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 weeks ago",
        "text": "Excellent, speedy service. Highly recommend.",
        "time": 1769790185,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Adam Szporer",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103432665584372295004/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVFQ4dX7gsEoNmccnlELIl7aOQInbGUlB9yWwX7EZkAWFXe2-k=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I had a wonderful experience with Lagacé Électrique for the purchase and installation of my standby generator. I had the chance to meet and/or speak with with Hugh, Marie-Pier, and Christina to do the initial evaluation and all the paperwork. They were all very helpful, responsive, and answered all of my questions.\n\nNicholas and Maxime were on site for the installation, and they did a great job. They were professional, attentive to my needs, and took the time to make sure everything was working well for me. Their work was neat and tidy, and they had a P-touch with them for the labelling to make it look especially nice.",
        "time": 1701478758,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "kyle J",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111576384600879304844/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUB_6Uzw-UItbckgbfJYHGoWCE5Am9OD10M-1NUbaVUpCasUmQL=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Very disappointed in the service I received.  I used to think very highly of Lagace Electrique, however after having them come to my house last month to rewire my basement I'm finding nothing but mistakes and issues. I mentioned one of the issues to them and they sent someone over promptly to fix it, however they had the nerve to charge me for the electrician to come over.  When I questioned the second invoice they argued with me and finally agree to credit it, however I'm finding a lot of other issues with the original work done.\nI have a bedroom, living room and bathroom all on one circuit.  There's a total of 12 outlets, three baseboards, an air exchanger, and gfi bathroom outlet all on one circuit. I questioned this three times and was told not to worry.\nThey wired an outlet outside of the framing wall, which means I basically have a wire sitting outside of the drywall.  I obviously have to have this rewired.  I called two other electricians to get quotes on some additional work and to show them what I've found and both were disappointed that a certified electrician would do this. Now after spending over $1800 with them, I'm forced to pay an additional $1500 to have THEIR work fixed.\nLagace used to be very good and reputable I'd suggest you go back to your roots and take pride and caution in your work.",
        "time": 1730917828,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Brigitte Bourque",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114177864405240712194/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU7T5zUhXSvJdIYK37WY_jRl-ITzdATjpveaOCvHMk6rTC5Usjw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Excellent work.  Replaced our electrical panel and entry to upgrade from 100 amps to 200. Very efficient, clean and professional at very competitive prices.  Would hire them again.",
        "time": 1605964567,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Steve Willams",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117652039366159630237/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWoKn6F7L4zbFnT77OFuq8NydnKeNROWIWL2qXWCuXDbganmG4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 years ago",
        "text": "My compliments to both the ownership and the team sent to completely change the lighting system at our business.\nOver 50 light fixtures were completely changed in less than 2 days, while enabling us to operate and service our customers at a very busy car care centre.\nThe work was efficient, professional, and reasonably priced.\nI do highly recommend Lagace Electrique.\nSteve Williams - Owner/ Steve's Car Care",
        "time": 1522360048,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
